WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:06.097
Hi guys! My name’s Michael.

00:00:06.097 --> 00:00:08.097
And today’s “I Gotta Question” is...

00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:15.349
"How can I make the transition from 
using my media skills for the world 
and using them for God?"

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:18.586
At first, I want to share you guys a verse.

00:00:27.373 --> 00:00:32.280
Well, speaking of my experience, I used to love movies and games.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.000
Well, speaking of my experience, I used to love movies and games.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.038
I’m so into media and just self taught myself many related skills.

00:00:40.038 --> 00:00:45.493
When Covid hit, people spend more and more time online due to the restriction.

00:00:45.493 --> 00:00:48.287
Media becomes more and more important.

00:00:48.287 --> 00:00:53.537
And during that time, I just graduated and just desperately needed a job.

00:00:53.537 --> 00:00:57.097
You know how hard it is to find a job during that time.

00:00:57.097 --> 00:01:00.990
I tried a lot of places, submitted hundreds of resumes

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.839
but none of them went through.

00:01:02.839 --> 00:01:07.964
To be honest, at that time, I thought I will never get a media related job that I want.

00:01:07.964 --> 00:01:10.828
I just can't. It's just too tough.

00:01:10.828 --> 00:01:15.215
I started to pray and my church family is also praying for me too.

00:01:15.215 --> 00:01:20.549
And during that time, my church is needing someone to edit videos.

00:01:20.549 --> 00:01:23.786
I have a lot of free time, so I offered my help.

00:01:23.786 --> 00:01:28.314
Then I started to taking over many media related work at my church.

00:01:28.314 --> 00:01:32.825
I edit videos, design logos, brochures, create websites.

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:36.590
I stopped being so anxious about job searching.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:40.323
I leave everything to God and I know God will provide.

00:01:40.323 --> 00:01:44.223
I just fully concentrate my skills to help my church.

00:01:44.223 --> 00:01:49.160
I’m thinking, you know, if I’m going to create media, why not create something good?

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.991
I have the skills and I want to help others.

00:01:51.991 --> 00:01:57.521
Out of one hundred projects that I created, if there is only one video, 

00:01:57.521 --> 00:02:02.063
only few people watched it and made a difference in one person's life,

00:02:02.063 --> 00:02:03.871
Then I think it's worth it.

00:02:03.871 --> 00:02:10.761
One day, one of my church members just approached me and introduced me to Little Light Studios.

00:02:10.761 --> 00:02:19.020
 That's how I get to know this ministry and looking back from now, I think this is just God's plan for me.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:25.291
I waited at the right time, put the trust in Him and He just gave me the perfect job for me.

00:02:25.291 --> 00:02:34.225
I can work at a ministry which serves God, help others and I’m doing media works, doing the things that I like.

00:02:34.225 --> 00:02:37.372
It's just like your dream job becomes true.

00:02:37.372 --> 00:02:41.521
I get paid to do the things I like to do. How amazing that is!

00:02:41.521 --> 00:02:44.891
So let’s get back to the question.

00:02:44.891 --> 00:02:46.964
How can you make the transition?

00:02:46.964 --> 00:02:50.414
First of all I think, don't give up.

00:02:50.414 --> 00:02:54.831
Please, please never give up on the talent that God gifted to you. 

00:02:54.831 --> 00:02:57.649
There are times you may find it frustrated,

00:02:57.649 --> 00:03:01.694
you think it's useless or you may think others can do better than you.

00:03:01.694 --> 00:03:08.342
But every human being is unique and the talent that God gifted to you is unique.

00:03:08.804 --> 00:03:11.047
So just keep doing what you wanted to do.

00:03:11.047 --> 00:03:14.345
But do be careful about the direction you choose though.

00:03:14.345 --> 00:03:17.546
God gives us the freedom to make choices.

00:03:17.546 --> 00:03:21.281
It's either God's side or Satan's side.

00:03:21.281 --> 00:03:26.001
Media is a powerful tool, but be sure to use it right.

00:03:26.001 --> 00:03:31.665
That little piece of information you put it out may make a huge impact on someone's life.

00:03:31.665 --> 00:03:34.948
So it's very important to identify which side are you on.

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:42.361
So my second suggestion is that, start to make something good even if it's tiny.

00:03:42.361 --> 00:03:48.435
You don't have to make those big Bible, teach lessons or straight-forward, preaching videos.

00:03:48.435 --> 00:03:53.522
You don't have to paint pictures of Jesus thousands times and put it all over the street.

00:03:53.522 --> 00:03:59.916
You can just simply by just doing little things, things that can help others, spread the love.

00:03:59.916 --> 00:04:03.801
Things that satan just never want you to do.

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:10.758
You can catch the beautiful creations that God made, look at the mountains, rivers, trees around you.

00:04:10.758 --> 00:04:22.128
Share them to others. You can write blogs, posts to encourage those who are in struggle, even just a single, warm comment would make a big difference to someone else.

00:04:22.128 --> 00:04:31.851
Video record the moments that God's working in your life, that people are spreading love, that people are doing good to others, helping others.

00:04:31.851 --> 00:04:33.127
Promote love.

00:04:33.127 --> 00:04:34.844
Share God's words.

00:04:34.844 --> 00:04:42.695
The point that I want to make is that using your media skills for the world and using it for God doesn't conflict with each other.

00:04:42.695 --> 00:04:46.923
I think, you know, God created the world, the world belongs to God.

00:04:46.923 --> 00:04:51.872
As long as you are doing what the Bible says, you stand on God's side.

00:04:51.872 --> 00:04:57.739
Put yourself in God's hands and let Him lead the way. Spread His message and love.

00:04:57.739 --> 00:04:59.832
You are already doing something for God.

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:03.809
You don't need to be in a church or a ministry to do God's work.

00:05:03.809 --> 00:05:09.880
You can do anything, anywhere, anytime to share God's message.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.404
And they don't need to be big or perfect. 

00:05:13.404 --> 00:05:16.093
So, let’s start today.

00:05:16.093 --> 00:05:20.104
Pick up your camera, your phone, your computer, your brushes.

00:05:20.104 --> 00:05:23.716
Just start to use your talent that God gifted to you.

00:05:23.716 --> 00:05:26.612
And you can become another Little Light Studios.

00:05:26.612 --> 00:05:30.018
At the end, let me share you guys another verse.

00:05:45.841 --> 00:05:47.467
Thank you guys for watching.

00:05:47.467 --> 00:05:52.047
Please make sure, you know, put a thumbs up and subscribe to us.

00:05:52.047 --> 00:05:57.762
And you can leave your questions to the comments or directly send the questions to us.

00:05:57.762 --> 00:05:58.899
And...

00:06:02.569 --> 00:06:04.873
And you can guess what I’m going to say.

00:06:04.873 --> 00:06:06.134
Kendi: “And bye, bye!”

00:06:06.694 --> 00:06:08.267
And bye, bye.

00:06:08.267 --> 00:06:09.326
再见

